- section: File Naming Conventions content: |

  ## Component Files

  - PascalCase, .tsx

  ## Non-Component

  - camelCase (formatDate.ts), kebab-case (next-config.mjs)

  ## Index Files

  - Dùng `index.ts` hoặc `index.tsx` cho export
